{"job_id":"F-510fb08688032d372a00","family_id":"F-510fb08688032d372a00","title":"군인 급식 규정","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003013-128702-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"7cc5499008157255f398d5bd448e64901efaf3f9d0f0b07f1cc0f218f28ffb8b","source_hash":"caa410ffa42b8daa835acdf816a4ddd9b27596b02f663d0706290ff31bb8f8ee","text":"军人膳食规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003013-128702-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":68,"target_id":"2a1371fdf660c0d6c57889f5b09f5e77cf46901aa68323daf47f9e5c4bf4f6a7","source_hash":"1b160bacd5eec72b468ea664b33fc14e713c64d9c1177394f125bdab69c4ade8","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定根据《军事人员法》第53条规定，现役军人膳食服务的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003013-128702-ko","scope":"BODY","start":68,"end":354,"target_id":"d313bfbc98007dc84859db2284c5dec3489621838d2c3d2da1cf4cde291142eb","source_hash":"6f1b52ad4caa9a5000dedb8487c647ec6050660a143ffd90ea0f768fe564b494","text":"第二条（膳食及膳食标准量）\n① 军人每日应享有主食和口粮（以下简称“实物”）。但是，对于奉陆军、海军或空军参谋长命令在基地外居住的军人，可以以现金形式支付一定金额（以下简称“标准伙食津贴”）代替实物。\n标准餐费金额应根据年度支出预算中为一名士兵每天提供实物物资所需成本确定。\n③ 对于符合第 1 款但书规定的士兵，应在下个月支付按每月标准伙食津贴乘以未收到货物的天数计算的金额。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003013-128702-ko","scope":"BODY","start":354,"end":425,"target_id":"07888fdec127b6d775b8ba846d8a5ed8dbfdb6c06083f64077ed3c48e18c61bb","source_hash":"3ef8ba6d4988df636e8960f0e1c7ad66ea54df2209a7d2e27a04e4f2f216413a","text":"第三条（授权规定）执行本法令所需事项，由陆军、海军和空军参谋长分别就各自军种作出决定，但须经国防部长批准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003013-128702-ko","scope":"BODY","start":425,"end":469,"target_id":"5e56f9c197fadae9be2c15b6556ed02e630f808c979955fe138bcdca2f692369","source_hash":"eeb3acd63deedefb29a651bf9a31c90ff7d155f9a16657e00bad7cf832e2be74","text":"补充规定 <第4903号，1970年4月10日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003013-128702-ko","scope":"BODY","start":469,"end":512,"target_id":"3e856877b7122b5025f1414ab816a4bb0912aad53603c84d9cd93dd0abe00e98","source_hash":"dbe4a19854c3470a87c943f0e6dd05f26321c2f6c4ee1c35272fced57744f796","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 7027，1974 年 1 月 4 日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003013-128702-ko","scope":"BODY","start":512,"end":536,"target_id":"c120892a5fb324a1e5702fcf171bec42dec8dbc37ea3dd1432cd38e093972dca","source_hash":"070a408c75355431fb2350c56c7e601029c03683cf55156c663178fadeab3667","text":"补充规定 <第24105号，2012年9月19日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003013-128702-ko","scope":"BODY","start":536,"end":565,"target_id":"f38fc36a80668de214310dac3b2a99537fc4843de3b093471188dacaa397a607","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003013-128702-ko","scope":"BODY","start":565,"end":652,"target_id":"7d688b96dd6bb8fa21dfb783465aebf7dcc16547e9a029555b0cdd1b3ca3258b","source_hash":"691dfb5c1bf1ecea72d3aebe62fc9b92425e422cf723e2b72cce43c234857dbc","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）《兵役法实施令》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第158条第3款中的“「士兵和军事人员膳食规定」”应改为“「士兵膳食规定」”。"}]}